  <Docs>
    <summary>
            Represents a control that allows a user to incrementally adjust a numeric value by tapping plus or minus buttons.
            </summary>
    <remarks>
            The <see cref="T:Microsoft.Maui.Controls.Stepper" /> provides buttons to increase or decrease a numeric value by a fixed <see cref="P:Microsoft.Maui.Controls.Stepper.Increment" />.
            The value is constrained between <see cref="P:Microsoft.Maui.Controls.Stepper.Minimum" /> and <see cref="P:Microsoft.Maui.Controls.Stepper.Maximum" />.
            </remarks>
  </Docs>
